Introduce `ι _ a b hab ha lam lam' nn hJ K _ _ _ _ _ ν _ _ r hr Q Λ`. Take `⟨-, hcomp, -, -, -, -, hsep, -⟩` from `GlobalTheory.T.fockSubstitution_identities ι a b hab`. Use `haveI : FiniteDimensional ℂ (VV ℂ lam) := Module.Finite.of_basis (bVV ℂ lam)`. Take `⟨S, c, hΛ⟩` from `dual_eq_sum_evalAt (VV ℂ lam) hsep Λ`. Establish `hav` using `fun y : {y : ι → Matrix (Fin a) (Fin a) ℂ // IsInv y} => GlobalTheory.KJAvg.avg_span ι a b hab ha lam nn K ν (fun k τ => ((r k τ : GL (Fin a) ℂ) : Matrix (Fin a) (Fin a) ℂ)) hr y.1 Q`.

Use `choose m y' s hinv hspan using hav`. Set `d : {y : ι → Matrix (Fin a) (Fin a) ℂ // IsInv y} → ℂ` to `fun y => (∏ τ, (y.1 τ).det ^ nn τ)⁻¹`. Use `⟨∑ y ∈ S, (c y * d y) • ∑ j, s y j • (evalL (y' y j)).comp (VV ℂ lam').subtype, fun ℓ h v => ?_⟩` and prove the remaining obligations. Set `hh : ι → Matrix (Fin b) (Fin b) ℂ` to `fun τ => ((h τ : GL (Fin b) ℂ) : Matrix (Fin b) (Fin b) ℂ)`. Set `Hh : ℂ` to `∏ τ, (hh τ).det ^ (lam' τ).detShift`.

Set `ℓ₀ : FP ι a b →ₗ[ℂ] ℂ` to `ℓ ∘ₗ (mvZ (fun _ => 1) hh).toLinearMap`. Set `F : PY ι a` to `(v : PY ι a) * ∏ τ, (Formalism.L2.Ker.frDet ℂ a τ : PY ι a) ^ nn τ`. Establish `hFV : F ∈ Vn lam nn` using `⟨v, (GlobalTheory.KJInf.ClsVal.cSpan_eq_VV' lam).symm ▸ v.2, rfl⟩`. Establish `hpt : ∀ k, (∏ τ, ((r k τ : GL (Fin a) ℂ) : Matrix (Fin a) (Fin a) ℂ).det ^ ((nn τ : ℤ) - (lam τ).detShift) * ((h τ : GL (Fin b) ℂ) : Matrix (Fin b) (Fin b) ℂ).det ^ (lam' τ).detShift) * ℓ (GlobalTheory.CompactHowe.substF (fun τ => ((h τ : GL (Fin b) ℂ) : Matrix (Fin b) (Fin b) ℂ) …`. Introduce `k`.

