Simplify using `only [evalAt_rhoK]`. Rewrite using `[hsub]`. Use `set L := ℓ₀ (mvZ (fun τ => (((r k τ : GL (Fin a) ℂ) : Matrix (Fin a) (Fin a) ℂ))⁻¹) (fun _ => 1) Q) with hL`. Establish `hL' : ℓ (mvZ (fun _ => 1) hh (mvZ (fun τ => (((r k τ : GL (Fin a) ℂ) : Matrix (Fin a) (Fin a) ℂ))⁻¹) (fun _ => 1) Q)) = L` using `rfl`. Establish `hH : (∏ τ, ((h τ : GL (Fin b) ℂ) : Matrix (Fin b) (Fin b) ℂ).det ^ (lam' τ).detShift) = Hh` using `rfl`.

Rewrite using `[hL', Finset.prod_mul_distrib, hH, Finset.mul_sum, Finset.mul_sum]`. Use `Finset.sum_congr rfl fun y _ => ?_` and prove the remaining obligations. Establish `hdet : ∀ τ, ((r k τ : GL (Fin a) ℂ) : Matrix (Fin a) (Fin a) ℂ).det ≠ 0` using `fun τ => (Matrix.isUnits_det_units _).ne_zero`. Establish `key : (∏ τ, ((r k τ : GL (Fin a) ℂ) : Matrix (Fin a) (Fin a) ℂ).det ^ ((nn τ : ℤ) - (lam τ).detShift)) * (∏ τ, ((r k τ : GL (Fin a) ℂ) : Matrix (Fin a) (Fin a) ℂ).det ^ (lam τ).detShift) = ∏ τ, ((r k τ : GL (Fin a) ℂ) : Matrix (Fin a) (Fin a) ℂ).det ^ nn τ`. Rewrite using `[← Finset.prod_mul_distrib]`.

