Simplify using `only [Matrix.det_mul, mul_pow]`. Rewrite using `[hF]`. Take the linear combination `(Hh * L * c y * evalAt (fun τ => ((r k τ : GL (Fin a) ℂ) : Matrix (Fin a) (Fin a) ℂ) * y.1 τ) (v : PY ι a)) * key - (Hh * L * c y * evalAt (fun τ => ((r k τ : GL (Fin a) ℂ) : Matrix (Fin a) (Fin a) ℂ) * y.1 τ) (v : PY ι a) * ∏ τ, ((r k τ : GL (Fin a) ℂ) : Matrix (Fin a) (Fin a) ℂ …`. Establish `hint : ∀ y : {y : ι → Matrix (Fin a) (Fin a) ℂ // IsInv y}, Integrable (fun k => c y * d y * (ℓ₀ (mvZ (fun τ => (((r k τ : GL (Fin a) ℂ) : Matrix (Fin a) (Fin a) ℂ))⁻¹) (fun _ => 1) Q) * evalAt (fun τ => ((r k τ : GL (Fin a) ℂ) : Matrix (Fin a) (Fin a) ℂ) * y.1 τ) F)) ν` using `fun y => (integrable_term ν hr ℓ₀ Q y.1 F).const_mul _`. Establish `hjet : ((Formalism.L2.Ker.jetOp lam lam' (fun m => ℓ (MvPolynomial.monomial m 1)) nn v : VV ℂ lam') : PY ι b) = Formalism.L2.Ker.jetMap (fun m => ℓ (MvPolynomial.monomial m 1)) nn (v : PY ι a)`.

Establish `hx : Formalism.L2.Ker.jetMap (fun m => ℓ (MvPolynomial.monomial m 1)) nn (v : PY ι a) = ((⟨_, hJ _ _ v.2⟩ : VV ℂ lam') : PY ι b)` using `rfl`. Simplify using `only [Formalism.L2.Ker.jetOp, Formalism.L2.Ker.retrVV, LinearMap.comp_apply, Submodule.subtype_apply]`. Rewrite using `[hx, Submodule.projectionOnto_apply_left]`. Establish `hav' : ∀ y : {y : ι → Matrix (Fin a) (Fin a) ℂ // IsInv y}, ∫ k, ℓ₀ (mvZ (fun τ => (((r k τ : GL (Fin a) ℂ) : Matrix (Fin a) (Fin a) ℂ))⁻¹) (fun _ => 1) Q) * evalAt (fun τ => ((r k τ : GL (Fin a) ℂ) : Matrix (Fin a) (Fin a) ℂ) * y.1 τ) F ∂ν = ∑ j, s y j * ℓ (subY hab (fun τ => hh …`. Introduce `y`.

Rewrite using `[hspan y F hFV ℓ₀]`. Use `Finset.sum_congr rfl fun j _ => ?_` and prove the remaining obligations. Use `show s y j * ℓ (mvZ (fun _ => 1) hh (subY hab (y' y j) F)) = _`. Rewrite using `[mvZ_subY]`. Establish `hH : (∏ τ, ((h τ : GL (Fin b) ℂ) : Matrix (Fin b) (Fin b) ℂ).det ^ (lam' τ).detShift) = Hh` using `rfl`.

Repeatedly rewrite using `[hpt]`. Rewrite using `[integral_const_mul, integral_finsetSum _ fun y _ => hint y]`. Simplify using `only [integral_const_mul, hav']`. Simplify using `only [LinearMap.sum_apply, LinearMap.smul_apply, LinearMap.comp_apply, Submodule.subtype_apply, evalL_apply, smul_eq_mul, evalAt_rhoK, hjet, GlobalTheory.KJInf.ClsVal.evalAt_jetMap hab, hH]`. Rewrite using `[Finset.mul_sum]`.

Use `Finset.sum_congr rfl fun y _ => ?_` and prove the remaining obligations. Rewrite using `[Finset.mul_sum, Finset.mul_sum, Finset.mul_sum]`. Use `Finset.sum_congr rfl fun j _ => ?_` and prove the remaining obligations. Expand and normalize the polynomial expressions, which then agree.
